RECORD Box
  value: optional<integer>
REQUEST choose
  GIVEN box is Box
  GIVEN replacement is Box
  GIVEN flag is boolean
  WHEN choose box through box with replacement if flag
  OUTPUT box is Box
WHEN choose <box> through <alias> with <replacement> if <flag>
  GIVEN box is Box
  AND alias is Box
  AND replacement is Box
  AND flag is boolean
  IF flag
    REQUIRE box.value is present
  ELSE
    REQUIRE box.value is present
  REQUIRE box.value is present
